  ;; `adapter` (EP-0036 F6, rf2-vo8fb) is the Freehand reactive-substrate
  ;; adapter — the value `(rf/init! v/adapter)` installs, `:kind
  ;; :rf.adapter/freehand`. It rides this `:cljs-only` block with the mount
  ;; verbs and for their reason: it is built on the core React spine
