  ;; `re-frame.ui.substrate` was not rowed behind `re-frame.ui/adapter`.
  ;;
  ;; FRONT-PORCH, and this is the one Freehand row where the tier is a
  ;; statement: an application's FIRST line of boot is `(rf/init! v/adapter)`,
