  ;; The seven Dynamic-mode Panel reg-views + the five Static-mode panel
  ;; reg-views (spec/API.md §Panel reg-views + §Static-mode Panel
  ;; reg-views). Each panel namespace exports a single public reg-view — the
  ;; bare-var symbol the Xray-spec projection check resolves. All export a
  ;; `Panel` except `static.machines.panel`, which exports a lowercase `panel`
  ;; (spec/API.md §Static-mode Panel reg-views). `implementation` (rf2-oekz6s):
  ;; these are the leaves the shell composes — NOT a host-facing single-panel
  ;; embed surface (hosts embed the FULL shell via the `mount-<panel>!` family
  ;; below, per 008-Embedding-Contract). They are exported only so the shell
  ;; can `:require` them across namespaces; an embedding host reaches for
  ;; `mount-shell!`, never a bare `Panel`. Demoted off `internal-public` (which
  ;; now means SUPPORTED host/tool embedding) to `implementation`
